      "raw": "<p>I was playing a game today in Time Cataclysm where Parse had her Buffer Overflow up, and Fixed Point was out. So, does she get to discard villian cards for free? Fixed point states:</p><blockquote><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: calibri, arial, sans, sans-serif; font-size: 110%;\">When a villain card would enter play, you may discard it instead and destroy this card.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 110%; font-family: calibri, arial, sans, sans-serif;\">When this card is destroyed, draw a card and play the top card of the villain deck.</span></p></blockquote><p>I realize discarding is not destroying, and the first part would play as normal. The only issue I&#39;m seeing is a simultaneous action of discarding and destroying, and if one can&#39;t be fulfilled, the entire first sentence is prevented from happening.</p>",
